 grind with all cards unlocked by default. Craft your strategy with new and redesigned cards, or jump straight in with pre-bu<strong>ilt decks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Reimagined Revolution</strong>s &amp; Political Choices– Revolution and Age-Up politicians have been redesigned with new options, units and strate<strong>gies to explore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• </strong>Modernized Gameplay &amp; Tools– Experience refined unit balance, campaign missions, naval formations, and expanded unit variety. Up your game with the built-in Spectator Mode, Phot<strong>o Mode, and M</strong>od Manager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bonus Content- Now includes all the content f<i>rom the United States, Mexic</i>o, and Hero Cosmetic Pack Vol 1DLCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump online to play with friends or test your skills in skirmishes against AI across a variety of maps. However you choose to play, enjoy stunning visuals, a fully remastered soundtrack, and modernized RTS gameplay in this third installment of the award-winning franchise. Complete your collection with the final chapter in the Age of Empires Definitive Edition journey.</p>", "short_description": "Lead powerful civilizations across the globe, master strategies and tactics, and relive history in co op battles—now remastered in stunning 4K and modernized gameplay.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese, Malay<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933110/0f85493ce793ef403f8619e5a0e1406f0c9058b2/header.jpg?t=1786724528", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s